    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc96 ADD OUR GAMES TO YOUR WISHLIST \ud83d\udc96</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/cad06fc41403ffc9f6022411bd620695.avif?t=1755084057\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udd25HOT MILFS ARE WAITING FOR YOU!!! \ud83d\udd25 \u2764\ufe0fTAKE YOUR PLACE, THEY WON'T WAIT FOREVER!! \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/daa735868f3773a2400950bb3126d812.avif?t=1755084057\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/wishlist_campaign_en_150k?t=1755084057\" width=616 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/8486686c6aa3137895daff84db8b2d4a.poster.avif?t=1755084057\" width=620 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/8486686c6aa3137895daff84db8b2d4a.webm?t=1755084057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the College of Magical Arts, an institution where you either unlock your magical potential or... end up in a 9 \u00be dorm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing all of your entrance exams and being exiled from home, you have no hope left. But an unexpected letter from a mysterious college gives you one last chance at a new life. Except there's just one problem: you have no magic. None at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing a test for magical abilities, you find yourself among the strangest students on campus. And on your first night, you're &quot;attacked&quot; by Lucy, an incubus who wants to get a taste of the fresh blood.... When you cum, Lucy's magical power overflows and he transforms from the excess power...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's then that you find out that you have a rare gift: you're an Amplifier, able to amplify other people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/3fb846c80efd1713c5645a435a624d03.avif?t=1755084057\" width=748 height=314 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/6b0c2a05ccb4d90d5457081f49f39ac8.avif?t=1755084057\" width=1490 height=1038 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/wishlist_campaign_en_150k?t=1755084057\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/8486686c6aa3137895daff84db8b2d4a.poster.avif?t=1755084057\" width=620 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/8486686c6aa3137895daff84db8b2d4a.webm?t=1755084057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the College of Magical Arts, an institution where you either unlock your magical potential or... end up in a 9 \u00be dorm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing all of your entrance exams and being exiled from home, you have no hope left. But an unexpected letter from a mysterious college gives you one last chance at a new life. Except there's just one problem: you have no magic. None at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing a test for magical abilities, you find yourself among the strangest students on campus. And on your first night, you're &quot;attacked&quot; by Lucy, an incubus who wants to get a taste of the fresh blood.... When you cum, Lucy's magical power overflows and he transforms from the excess power...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's then that you find out that you have a rare gift: you're an Amplifier, able to amplify other people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/3fb846c80efd1713c5645a435a624d03.avif?t=1755084057\" width=748 height=314 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/6b0c2a05ccb4d90d5457081f49f39ac8.avif?t=1755084057\" width=1490 height=1038 /></span></p>",
